      "text": "serve God that ye may stand blameless before him, D&C 4:2. take up the Lord’s whole armor, that ye may be able to stand, D&C 27:15. wicked shall not stand, D&C 29:11. land of inheritance promised while earth shall stand, D&C 38:20. stand in place of thy stewardship, D&C 42:53. stand in holy places, D&C 45:32 (87:8; 101:22). Church to stand independent above all other creatures, D&C 78:14. the Lord stands in midst of his people, D&C 84:101 (133:25). let every man stand in his own office, D&C 84:109. because of earthquakes men shall fall, not be able to stand, D&C 88:89. slothful shall not be counted worthy to stand, D&C 107:100. we saw the Lord standing upon breastwork, D&C 110:2.",
